WEBVTT

01:41.470 --> 01:45.990
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.470 --> 01:48.900
[Episode 36]

01:49.400 --> 01:50.840
Su Yishui is no longer here.

01:51.150 --> 01:51.680
What?

01:53.270 --> 01:54.750
Are you here to seize this body?

01:55.560 --> 01:56.870
Jade Pool, lend me your spiritual energy!

02:12.960 --> 02:13.560
Shui,

02:14.680 --> 02:16.280
I know the void in your past

02:16.430 --> 02:17.590
has made your spiritual sense unstable.

02:17.960 --> 02:18.680
But you said before

02:18.960 --> 02:20.280
that you wanted to find the answer on your own.

02:20.680 --> 02:21.470
Don't let the devil

02:21.750 --> 02:22.680
trap your heart.

02:23.520 --> 02:24.400
Stop dreaming.

02:25.430 --> 02:27.000
How long do you think you can hold on?

02:28.120 --> 02:30.400
You're no different from other demons.

02:30.870 --> 02:32.470
You occupied such a good mortal body,

02:32.710 --> 02:34.030
but didn't even gain any advantages?

02:34.960 --> 02:35.870
I'm different.

02:36.150 --> 02:38.150
The wisdom I gained from two lifetimes

02:38.760 --> 02:40.160
has allowed me to perfect

02:40.190 --> 02:41.190
the formation I created.

02:41.590 --> 02:42.710
Now, even if I can't wake you up,

02:43.000 --> 02:43.870
I'll take you down,

02:44.190 --> 02:45.100
tie you up, and bring you back

02:45.560 --> 02:46.590
to teach you a good lesson.

03:02.190 --> 03:02.870
What a pity.

03:03.960 --> 03:05.870
The power of the Spirit Spring is truly strong.

03:06.470 --> 03:08.120
Even with the power of the heavens and earth that I borrowed,

03:08.560 --> 03:09.560
it was hard to take him down.

03:10.820 --> 03:12.100
He's only just fallen into demonic ways,

03:12.430 --> 03:13.800
and he's already this difficult to deal with.

03:14.720 --> 03:15.550
If the Spirit Spring

03:15.710 --> 03:17.320
becomes fully adapted to this mortal body,

03:18.030 --> 03:19.350
I'm afraid no one will be able to defeat him.

03:21.880 --> 03:22.530
Miss Xue,

03:22.870 --> 03:23.910
his goal this time

03:24.310 --> 03:25.520
is the spiritual channel of the Eternal Sect.

03:26.270 --> 03:27.870
So what they need is the spiritual channels.

03:29.760 --> 03:31.880
It seems now that the energy

03:32.430 --> 03:33.280
the Three Thousand Realms Tower needs

03:33.680 --> 03:35.120
relies on the spiritual channels

03:35.140 --> 03:36.510
of the Five Heavenly Sects' mountains.

03:38.079 --> 03:38.870
I'm afraid the Five Sects

03:39.079 --> 03:40.680
are all their targets.

03:53.310 --> 03:53.870
Leave!

03:54.240 --> 03:54.920
Leave! All of you!

03:59.110 --> 03:59.910
My Lord!

04:01.470 --> 04:01.870
My Lord,

04:02.240 --> 04:03.200
one of the scouts following Elder Tu

04:03.220 --> 04:03.870
has returned.

04:05.840 --> 04:06.150
Quick,

04:06.470 --> 04:07.080
bring him in immediately.

04:09.810 --> 04:10.400
My Lord.

04:13.120 --> 04:13.910
Greetings, My Lord.

04:15.430 --> 04:16.310
Did she regret it

04:16.510 --> 04:17.240
and not go far?

04:17.630 --> 04:18.870
Does she look toward the direction

04:19.000 --> 04:20.070
of Mount Scarlet Flame from time to time?

04:20.750 --> 04:22.140
Elder Tu used a speed talisman

04:22.270 --> 04:23.360
and didn't stop once as she headed south,

04:23.620 --> 04:24.530
reaching a village at the foot

04:24.560 --> 04:25.160
of Mount Cold Autumn.

04:25.560 --> 04:26.480
She rented a small courtyard by a stream

04:26.530 --> 04:27.530
with trees and fields

04:27.780 --> 04:28.510
and settled there.

04:30.120 --> 04:31.290
She ran quite far.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.080
The south is very humid.

04:33.510 --> 04:34.430
Living in that small village

04:34.600 --> 04:35.720
probably isn't very convenient.

04:36.360 --> 04:37.070
Can she get used to it?

04:38.659 --> 04:39.830
Elder Tu's injury hasn't healed yet.

04:40.000 --> 04:40.880
She didn't do much.

04:41.480 --> 04:42.950
She just sits in the courtyard every day,

04:43.120 --> 04:44.480
staring at the distant mountains in a daze.

04:44.830 --> 04:46.040
Why was she in such a hurry to leave

04:46.070 --> 04:47.000
when her injury hadn't healed?

04:47.750 --> 04:48.870
Find a doctor she doesn't know,

04:49.170 --> 04:50.120
have him check her condition,

04:50.390 --> 04:51.070
no matter the method,

04:51.159 --> 04:51.920
and help her recover.

04:52.420 --> 04:52.780
But...

04:53.190 --> 04:53.950
don't let her notice.

04:54.870 --> 04:55.270
Yes.

04:56.100 --> 04:56.560
Wait.

04:59.240 --> 04:59.830
She...

05:00.000 --> 05:01.320
just looks at the mountains every day?

05:02.680 --> 05:04.040
Is that the life she wants?

05:05.240 --> 05:06.000
Doesn't she get bored?

05:06.630 --> 05:07.720
The villagers there are hospitable.

05:07.830 --> 05:08.830
They often visit her,

05:09.000 --> 05:10.430
bring her things, and chat with her for a while.

05:10.630 --> 05:11.680
Elder Tu doesn't refuse.

05:12.000 --> 05:12.720
Talking and laughing,

05:12.750 --> 05:13.560
half the day goes by just like that.

05:14.270 --> 05:14.600
She...

05:16.070 --> 05:17.000
She laughs?

05:19.040 --> 05:19.800
She often laughs.

05:25.380 --> 05:26.270
I don't even remember

05:26.830 --> 05:28.000
what she looks like when she laughs.

05:29.760 --> 05:30.830
She hasn't laughed

05:31.510 --> 05:32.750
in front of me for a long time.

05:35.790 --> 05:36.640
No matter who you are,

05:35.990 --> 05:38.760
[Hollow Sect]

05:37.190 --> 05:38.000
you are not allowed to trespass

05:38.000 --> 05:39.040
on the Hollow Sect!

05:47.360 --> 05:48.560
Your opponent is me.

05:49.159 --> 05:50.040
You really came with the intention

05:50.040 --> 05:51.480
of targeting the spiritual channel of the Hollow Sect.

05:51.830 --> 05:53.360
You really are persistent

05:53.360 --> 05:54.360
and hard to shake off.

05:54.880 --> 05:56.320
Don't flatter yourself.

05:56.640 --> 05:58.050
You think I'm here for you?

05:58.490 --> 06:00.050
I'm here to find my Shui.

06:00.220 --> 06:01.570
We are deeply in love,

06:01.600 --> 06:02.430
never apart.

06:02.720 --> 06:04.160
Naturally, wherever he is, I will be there.

06:05.310 --> 06:06.630
Deploy the Sky Enclosure Formation!

06:15.270 --> 06:16.230
He escaped pretty fast.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.200
He's actually this kind of demon.

06:19.470 --> 06:20.030
Ranran,

06:20.360 --> 06:21.320
thank you a lot for today.

06:21.920 --> 06:22.870
Otherwise, the Hollow Sect

06:22.930 --> 06:23.700
would surely have suffered.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.960
We can only know what Dun Tian plans to do

06:26.290 --> 06:27.770
every time he takes a step.

06:28.190 --> 06:29.480
We're far too passive.

06:30.330 --> 06:31.600
We must figure out the specific method

06:31.800 --> 06:32.600
to activate the Three Thousand Realms Tower

06:32.600 --> 06:34.159
as soon as possible.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.750
The first step to activate the Three Thousand Realms Tower

06:43.600 --> 06:44.630
is to obtain

06:44.880 --> 06:46.120
the spiritual power of the Five Heavenly Sects.

06:46.990 --> 06:47.950
You told me to entrust this matter to you

06:47.950 --> 06:49.070
with confidence,

06:49.470 --> 06:51.230
but there's still no progress.

06:51.760 --> 06:52.360
Isn't it because of

06:52.360 --> 06:53.630
that troublesome Mu Qingge,

06:54.190 --> 06:55.310
the one you trained yourself?

06:56.120 --> 06:57.390
Is this girl

06:57.630 --> 06:58.909
really that hard to kill?

06:59.480 --> 07:00.240
Or is it that

07:00.920 --> 07:01.790
you haven't

07:02.210 --> 07:03.450
fully tamed this body yet,

07:03.950 --> 07:04.920
and that Su Yishui's

07:04.940 --> 07:06.180
spiritual sense is still present,

07:06.830 --> 07:07.510
instinctively

07:07.530 --> 07:08.610
protecting this girl,

07:09.160 --> 07:10.790
so that every time you met her,

07:11.790 --> 07:13.080
you couldn't do anything to her?

07:14.820 --> 07:15.430
He's just a broken spiritual sense

07:15.430 --> 07:17.190
whose soul was cleansed

07:17.800 --> 07:19.040
and has long been completely devoured by me.

07:19.520 --> 07:20.550
How could there be any instincts?

07:21.630 --> 07:22.600
It's only because that Mu Qingge

07:22.620 --> 07:23.860
has the Gold Refining Fire in her hands

07:24.050 --> 07:25.400
and has cultivated a technique that can

07:25.430 --> 07:26.800
continuously draw strength from the heavens and earth

07:27.070 --> 07:28.480
that she managed to survive for a moment.

07:28.940 --> 07:29.750
Once my demonic energy

07:29.750 --> 07:31.430
fully adapts to this remnant body,

07:31.680 --> 07:33.159
I will make her die a quick death.

07:35.150 --> 07:36.080
But remember,

07:36.510 --> 07:37.360
time waits for no one.

07:37.720 --> 07:38.800
If a direct attack is hard to accomplish,

07:39.240 --> 07:40.270
we can always use strategy.

07:41.070 --> 07:42.310
There is a demonic creature in the netherworld

07:42.750 --> 07:44.580
called Two-headed Deceptive Python.

07:45.630 --> 07:47.830
I brought its demonic egg out earlier.

07:48.120 --> 07:49.159
Come with me

07:49.390 --> 07:50.270
and awaken it,

07:50.810 --> 07:52.890
and all our problems will be solved.

08:05.070 --> 08:07.110
It really is the demonic egg of a Two-headed Deceptive Python.

08:07.630 --> 08:08.670
If it is born,

08:08.990 --> 08:10.310
the Heavenly Sects will definitely fall into chaos.

08:12.930 --> 08:14.610
It's just not yet at the hatching stage.

08:15.370 --> 08:16.010
However,

08:16.230 --> 08:17.990
you can use your pure demonic energy

08:18.950 --> 08:19.910
to aid its incubation

08:20.540 --> 08:21.660
and awaken it.

08:40.950 --> 08:42.120
Is everything you said true?

08:42.690 --> 08:44.030
Your Highness, you still trust me

08:44.450 --> 08:45.690
and secretly ordered me to investigate the matter

08:45.720 --> 08:46.960
of Su Yishui falling into demonic ways at Mount Scarlet Flame.

08:47.510 --> 08:48.200
I will not

08:48.220 --> 08:49.220
fail your trust.

08:49.870 --> 08:51.200
Now, it has already spread throughout the Heavenly Sects.

08:51.840 --> 08:52.550
The only way for Dun Tian

08:52.550 --> 08:53.910
to activate the Three Thousand Realms Tower

08:53.930 --> 08:55.440
is to sacrifice everything in this world.

08:56.680 --> 08:57.200
Your Highness!

09:00.840 --> 09:02.030
He never told me.

09:03.630 --> 09:04.270
He never said that

09:04.290 --> 09:05.440
he would destroy everything here.

09:05.510 --> 09:06.000
Your Highness!

09:08.180 --> 09:09.060
Your Highness, your eyes...

09:09.800 --> 09:11.630
Your Highness, since you can no longer see clearly,

09:12.170 --> 09:13.410
why bother with trivial matters

09:13.590 --> 09:14.830
that don't concern you?

09:15.770 --> 09:16.650
Trivial matters?

09:18.200 --> 09:19.440
You recklessly lured demonic creatures

09:19.460 --> 09:20.650
out of the netherworld,

09:21.160 --> 09:22.230
hurting and harming people,

09:22.260 --> 09:23.730
causing chaos among my people,

09:24.440 --> 09:25.320
and you call these trivial matters?

09:27.580 --> 09:28.930
And you call activating the Three Thousand Realms Tower

09:28.960 --> 09:30.150
and destroying everything here

09:31.030 --> 09:32.110
trivial matters?

09:37.320 --> 09:38.530
How dare you harm my people?

09:40.240 --> 09:42.000
Your Highness, if you have any questions in the future,

09:42.320 --> 09:43.360
you can ask me directly.

09:43.870 --> 09:45.000
There's no need

09:45.390 --> 09:46.480
for all this trouble.

09:51.200 --> 09:51.960
You may leave.

09:52.390 --> 09:53.030
But Your Highness...

09:53.240 --> 09:53.720
It's fine.

09:57.150 --> 09:58.550
He doesn't dare to hurt me yet.

10:14.600 --> 10:16.000
I need to know now

10:18.270 --> 10:20.080
what will happen when you activate

10:21.200 --> 10:22.240
the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

10:24.910 --> 10:26.390
Your Highness, don't you already know?

10:27.120 --> 10:28.360
Is there no other way

10:29.360 --> 10:30.200
or method?

10:31.300 --> 10:32.570
Or are you truly planning

10:32.600 --> 10:33.870
to destroy the lives of everyone here

10:34.790 --> 10:35.870
and everything?

10:37.990 --> 10:38.630
Your Highness,

10:39.600 --> 10:40.910
activating the Three Thousand Realms Tower

10:41.440 --> 10:42.270
can bring you back

10:42.600 --> 10:44.030
to that moment

10:44.170 --> 10:45.840
in the world you long for.

10:47.650 --> 10:48.480
You don't think

10:48.650 --> 10:50.130
such a heaven-defying spell

10:50.780 --> 10:52.380
comes without a price, do you?

10:53.660 --> 10:54.330
Price?

10:56.080 --> 10:57.440
The price is enormous.

11:00.600 --> 11:02.240
Why did you never tell me this before?

11:05.690 --> 11:06.720
Because it's not important.

11:09.100 --> 11:10.020
Not important?

11:13.240 --> 11:14.000
This world

11:14.390 --> 11:16.550
is just one of countless others,

11:17.110 --> 11:19.040
one star in the vast universe.

11:19.390 --> 11:20.440
If this world is destroyed,

11:20.840 --> 11:22.670
there will be a new one

11:22.960 --> 11:24.200
welcoming you.

11:24.720 --> 11:25.360
And Your Highness,

11:25.480 --> 11:27.080
since you want your wish to be fulfilled,

11:27.510 --> 11:28.910
why do you still care about

11:29.120 --> 11:30.960
the world you've already given up on?

11:32.360 --> 11:33.440
What are you talking about?

11:35.030 --> 11:35.750
Everything here

11:35.750 --> 11:36.790
isn't just a mere illusion.

11:38.440 --> 11:39.720
They are all

11:39.720 --> 11:40.510
existing beings.

11:42.440 --> 11:44.000
And there are my people who trust me,

11:44.360 --> 11:45.600
the people of Great Qi—

11:46.510 --> 11:48.240
how can I just watch them fade away?

11:49.840 --> 11:50.840
I put so much effort into

11:50.840 --> 11:52.000
achieving peace at the borders

11:52.870 --> 11:53.910
and bringing prosperity and peace to the country.

11:57.480 --> 11:58.870
And I will not leave anything behind?

11:59.030 --> 11:59.480
No.

12:00.630 --> 12:01.910
For you,

12:02.200 --> 12:04.000
this is just like death.

12:04.150 --> 12:05.080
Are you actually hoping for

12:05.150 --> 12:07.360
a posthumous reputation?

12:12.030 --> 12:12.790
Or is it that

12:13.240 --> 12:14.600
you couldn't bring yourself to do it now?

12:15.630 --> 12:16.960
Don't forget,

12:17.870 --> 12:19.390
the lifespan I forcibly reversed for you

12:19.600 --> 12:20.840
through magic

12:20.910 --> 12:22.840
can only last for half a year.

12:23.270 --> 12:24.510
After 6 months,

12:24.870 --> 12:27.840
your body will inevitably suffer a backlash.

12:28.670 --> 12:29.360
By then,

12:30.390 --> 12:31.840
it will be even worse than it is now.

12:39.320 --> 12:39.910
Your Highness.

12:42.080 --> 12:42.630
Your Highness,

12:42.630 --> 12:43.910
you can no longer see me clearly.

12:44.690 --> 12:46.220
But I forgot to tell you that,

12:46.720 --> 12:48.080
in no time at all,

12:48.390 --> 12:49.780
you will lose your sense of taste

12:50.320 --> 12:51.480
and smell.

12:52.020 --> 12:53.540
Your sense of touch will also weaken,

12:53.630 --> 12:55.470
and even your hearing will completely disappear.

12:56.150 --> 12:56.790
By then,

12:57.270 --> 12:58.750
you'll be like a pile of dead flesh,

12:59.240 --> 13:00.480
lying there,

13:01.320 --> 13:02.150
day after day,

13:02.910 --> 13:04.080
only waiting for death.

13:10.970 --> 13:12.640
At that time, you will surely long

13:12.670 --> 13:14.390
for the vibrant health you once had,

13:14.790 --> 13:16.480
the vigorous strength you once possessed,

13:16.790 --> 13:17.600
and

13:18.200 --> 13:18.960
those wishes

13:18.980 --> 13:21.100
you could never fulfill.

13:25.480 --> 13:26.030
Your Highness,

13:26.900 --> 13:28.290
do you no longer desire

13:28.320 --> 13:29.440
what I just mentioned?

13:32.110 --> 13:33.680
Are you threatening me?

13:34.320 --> 13:34.750
No,

13:35.600 --> 13:36.600
I dare not.

13:37.120 --> 13:38.750
I'm just reminding you how to choose

13:39.030 --> 13:40.330
between what's important

13:40.510 --> 13:41.720
and what's not.

13:42.720 --> 13:43.360
Of course,

13:44.080 --> 13:46.630
between yourself and all living beings,

13:47.360 --> 13:49.000
you can only choose one side.

13:49.870 --> 13:50.750
Are you actually going to

13:50.770 --> 13:53.410
sacrifice yourself

13:53.620 --> 13:54.700
and willingly enter hell?

13:56.970 --> 13:58.060
You're so smart.

13:58.920 --> 13:59.670
I don't believe that.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.150
You're not trying to resurrect a demon.

14:04.030 --> 14:05.510
You are the demon.

14:10.110 --> 14:11.240
You've led me to abandon my bottom line

14:11.240 --> 14:12.240
again and again.

14:13.370 --> 14:14.600
I'm afraid that in the end,

14:14.630 --> 14:15.840
I'll lose even myself completely.

14:17.390 --> 14:18.120
Rather than...

14:19.550 --> 14:20.790
Rather than letting that day come,

14:21.780 --> 14:22.750
I would rather die

14:22.750 --> 14:24.600
and destroy everything you've planned,

14:25.930 --> 14:27.090
giving myself a clean slate.

14:43.750 --> 14:44.360
How was it?

14:45.550 --> 14:47.200
Was this the closest you've ever been

14:47.560 --> 14:48.400
to death?

14:49.220 --> 14:50.030
How did it feel?

14:52.910 --> 14:54.000
You're tricking me?

14:55.550 --> 14:56.600
How dare I?

14:57.550 --> 14:59.240
Shouldn't you be grateful

14:59.690 --> 15:01.090
that I stopped your impulse

15:02.030 --> 15:04.360
and gave you another chance at life?

15:05.220 --> 15:06.910
You should cherish the present now.

15:08.110 --> 15:08.960
Despicable.

15:19.230 --> 15:19.920
Your Highness,

15:23.720 --> 15:25.240
as long as you can fulfill your wish,

15:25.930 --> 15:26.860
what does it matter

15:27.230 --> 15:28.040
to be a little selfish

15:28.590 --> 15:29.520
or despicable?

15:29.870 --> 15:31.270
You are heaven's chosen one.

15:31.670 --> 15:33.080
How can ordinary people compare

15:33.080 --> 15:33.910
to your importance?

15:34.630 --> 15:36.840
Only when you activate the Three Thousand Realms Tower

15:37.440 --> 15:38.630
can you truly escape

15:38.630 --> 15:39.600
from death

15:39.750 --> 15:40.480
and fulfill the ideals

15:40.500 --> 15:42.590
and ambitions that are now beyond your power.

16:27.270 --> 16:28.080
Uncle Ye Xin.

16:29.200 --> 16:30.200
That day at Mount Scarlet Flame,

16:30.840 --> 16:31.720
I knew you would

16:31.750 --> 16:32.960
arrange everything.

16:33.270 --> 16:34.480
I shouldn't have gone there

16:34.480 --> 16:35.200
without your permission.

16:36.150 --> 16:37.000
But I sincerely

16:37.000 --> 16:38.200
wanted to help you.

16:38.270 --> 16:38.790
Wu,

16:39.240 --> 16:40.750
I don't hate human greed.

16:41.550 --> 16:42.120
After all,

16:42.630 --> 16:44.210
it's desire that creates existence

16:44.540 --> 16:46.270
and myriad worlds.

16:46.790 --> 16:47.440
However,

16:48.960 --> 16:50.960
I hate lies that shatter at the slightest touch.

16:52.960 --> 16:54.030
Uncle Ye Xin, I was wrong.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.550
I just hope that

16:57.630 --> 16:58.600
when you activate

16:58.630 --> 16:59.910
the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

17:00.870 --> 17:02.150
you'll take me with you.

17:04.829 --> 17:06.109
I also want to go to that world—

17:08.030 --> 17:09.720
a world without Mu Qingge,

17:11.310 --> 17:12.349
a world where I can lead

17:12.589 --> 17:14.000
the Heavenly Sects.

17:19.160 --> 17:20.160
As for what happened at Mount Scarlet Flame,

17:20.790 --> 17:22.359
you didn't really affect anything.

17:22.920 --> 17:23.640
I don't blame you.

17:24.550 --> 17:25.640
As long as you handle the tasks

17:25.640 --> 17:26.640
I asked you to do well.

17:28.640 --> 17:30.070
I will do my best.

17:30.830 --> 17:31.510
Next,

17:32.030 --> 17:32.720
I will hide Su Yu

17:32.750 --> 17:34.070
in a secret place

17:34.090 --> 17:35.250
and let him rest.

17:35.930 --> 17:37.000
Take good care of him.

17:37.950 --> 17:39.470
Don't let any accidents happen.

17:41.290 --> 17:42.260
I see.

17:53.640 --> 17:55.070
I wonder how he's doing now.

18:02.070 --> 18:02.960
It's still not working.

18:03.790 --> 18:04.720
Dun Tian used a formation

18:04.750 --> 18:05.960
to isolate Su Yishui.

18:06.640 --> 18:08.120
I can't contact him using spiritual power.

18:08.720 --> 18:10.030
I must think of another way.

18:10.310 --> 18:10.720
Master.

18:12.680 --> 18:13.200
Zeng.

18:14.030 --> 18:15.270
We received this letter just now.

18:18.210 --> 18:18.970
It says

18:19.000 --> 18:20.480
that a demon python is causing trouble in Mount Cold Autumn,

18:20.680 --> 18:21.830
and they hope we can go there and eliminate the demon.

18:22.460 --> 18:23.720
Not attacking the Heavenly Sects

18:23.750 --> 18:25.000
but targeting the common people?

18:25.590 --> 18:26.240
Is this one of

18:26.240 --> 18:27.000
Dun Tian's plans as well?

18:28.920 --> 18:29.960
I'll go and check it out right away.

18:30.310 --> 18:31.110
If anything happens at the Wester Sect,

18:31.440 --> 18:32.550
inform me immediately through sound transmission.

18:33.000 --> 18:33.350
Okay.

18:37.850 --> 18:40.950
[Mount Cold Autumn]

18:38.270 --> 18:38.750
Sovereign.

18:40.070 --> 18:41.350
I told you to take good care of her.

18:41.880 --> 18:42.550
Where is she now?

18:42.790 --> 18:43.420
Sovereign,

18:43.720 --> 18:45.130
Elder Tu received a request for help from the villagers

18:45.200 --> 18:46.150
and went deep into the mountains to eliminate a demon.

18:46.480 --> 18:47.880
She hasn't returned for two days.

18:48.440 --> 18:49.400
There's a strong demonic aura in the mountains.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.110
I searched all night last night

18:51.480 --> 18:51.990
but...

18:52.200 --> 18:53.180
but still haven't found her.

18:53.510 --> 18:54.070
Useless!

18:57.030 --> 18:58.640
She actually has the kindness to eliminate demons?

18:59.270 --> 19:00.640
And she hasn't returned for two days?

19:02.830 --> 19:03.880
What kind of powerful demon could

19:04.200 --> 19:05.270
be here in such a small mountain,

19:05.880 --> 19:06.990
capable of trapping my people?

19:09.680 --> 19:10.110
Let's go!

19:12.550 --> 19:13.160
Run!

19:13.180 --> 19:14.020
Run!

19:15.550 --> 19:16.550
There's a demon in the mist!

19:16.840 --> 19:18.010
There's a demon in the mist!

19:18.310 --> 19:19.240
Help!

19:35.000 --> 19:35.720
Come out and talk to me.

19:36.370 --> 19:38.020
I don't have time to play with you.

19:58.570 --> 19:59.450
I only know that in this world,

19:59.480 --> 20:00.590
there are Deceptive Pythons that are good at hiding.

20:01.270 --> 20:02.240
It's the first time I've ever seen

20:02.510 --> 20:03.440
a two-headed Deceptive Python.

20:07.720 --> 20:08.920
Did you eat her?

20:33.350 --> 20:34.480
There's no trace of her spiritual power

20:34.830 --> 20:35.920
in this Deceptive Python.

20:48.110 --> 20:48.950
Tu Jiuyuan?

20:59.530 --> 21:01.140
These demon wolves are quite something.

21:01.750 --> 21:03.200
Their fangs are surprisingly sharp.

21:10.270 --> 21:10.880
Are you alright?

21:12.640 --> 21:13.640
Why are you here?

21:16.210 --> 21:17.450
I encountered this Two-headed Deceptive Python

21:17.750 --> 21:18.590
and thought you had been killed.

21:19.310 --> 21:20.510
I've been calling for you all over this mountain

21:20.870 --> 21:22.000
and finally found you here.

21:25.240 --> 21:25.880
I'm fine.

21:26.880 --> 21:27.510
You don't need to worry about me.

21:29.720 --> 21:30.110
Don't go.

21:31.510 --> 21:32.610
The demon wolf's aura is poisonous.

21:32.880 --> 21:33.510
You can't be careless.

21:40.960 --> 21:42.550
Only by resting will the wounds heal faster.

21:43.070 --> 21:43.800
Come back with me.

21:53.070 --> 21:53.480
What...

21:53.880 --> 21:54.690
What happened here?

21:54.880 --> 21:55.350
-This...
-Wait.

21:55.920 --> 21:56.310
Don't move!

21:57.680 --> 21:58.720
-Who are you?
-You're fake.

21:58.750 --> 21:59.270
I'm the real one.

21:59.290 --> 22:00.070
You're the fake.

22:00.070 --> 22:00.590
You're the fake!

22:00.610 --> 22:02.110
Hurry up and kill the extra ones.

22:05.830 --> 22:06.270
It's in chaos.

22:06.730 --> 22:07.250
Everything's in chaos.

22:07.960 --> 22:08.880
I need to inform

22:09.440 --> 22:10.240
Elder Wen about this.

22:15.640 --> 22:16.240
Bad news!

22:16.340 --> 22:16.790
Elder Wen!

22:17.240 --> 22:18.110
What happened?

22:18.510 --> 22:19.200
The blood of that strange python

22:19.440 --> 22:21.030
can duplicate a person identical

22:21.270 --> 22:22.110
to the original.

22:22.510 --> 22:23.640
What kind of demonic technique is this?

22:23.730 --> 22:24.400
Elder Wen!

22:25.100 --> 22:25.720
Elder Wen!

22:27.680 --> 22:28.030
You...

22:29.030 --> 22:29.720
When did I...

22:30.000 --> 22:31.110
get duplicated?

22:31.790 --> 22:33.000
It's clearly you impersonating me.

22:33.720 --> 22:35.570
The Hollow Sect's Heart Technique is never taught to outsiders.

22:36.110 --> 22:37.880
Each of you, use the technique and attack me,

22:38.090 --> 22:39.410
and I'll know immediately whether you're real or fake.

22:41.720 --> 22:42.410
Elder Wen,

22:42.780 --> 22:43.500
please forgive me.

22:47.160 --> 22:48.720
Even the techniques you use are identical.

22:49.100 --> 22:50.660
If you can't tell the difference,

22:51.020 --> 22:52.210
I have a way to find out.

23:00.550 --> 23:01.550
So you're all fakes!

23:01.830 --> 23:02.270
Be careful!

23:02.290 --> 23:03.310
Don't let the blue blood touch you!

23:03.350 --> 23:03.750
Yes!

23:18.310 --> 23:19.110
Elder Wen,

23:19.920 --> 23:21.400
you're the only one left.

23:30.010 --> 23:30.560
You may leave now.

23:30.920 --> 23:31.350
Yes!

23:37.350 --> 23:38.200
Don't leave tonight.

23:39.190 --> 23:39.950
Stay and keep me company.

23:46.640 --> 23:47.240
Jiuyuan,

23:48.270 --> 23:48.960
only you

23:49.590 --> 23:51.030
can make my heart flutter like this.

24:09.150 --> 24:10.500
You shameless imposter!

24:11.030 --> 24:12.400
How dare you impersonate me!

24:12.750 --> 24:13.880
I will kill you!

24:15.790 --> 24:16.920
You demon.

24:17.270 --> 24:18.510
It's one thing to impersonate those blockheads

24:18.510 --> 24:19.830
from the Heavenly Sects,

24:20.440 --> 24:22.350
but how dare you come to my Celestial Sect to cause trouble?

24:23.110 --> 24:23.750
Today,

24:24.160 --> 24:25.270
you won't escape.

24:42.400 --> 24:42.920
Guards!

24:43.270 --> 24:44.110
Arrest him!

24:47.480 --> 24:48.400
Are you all blind?

24:49.740 --> 24:50.780
He's the imposter!

24:51.040 --> 24:52.040
I'm the real one!

24:56.110 --> 24:56.700
Tu Jiuyuan,

24:57.020 --> 24:57.510
come on.

24:57.720 --> 24:58.880
Even you can't tell the difference between us?

24:59.440 --> 25:00.680
You said you've loved me for decades.

25:01.340 --> 25:02.500
You've only been gone for a few days,

25:03.000 --> 25:04.400
and now you're denying it?

25:05.710 --> 25:06.300
Jiuyuan

25:06.590 --> 25:08.070
is the love of my life.

25:08.590 --> 25:10.400
Now she's even carrying my child.

25:11.240 --> 25:13.240
Treating her like a treasure isn't even enough for me.

25:13.880 --> 25:15.000
You demon.

25:15.240 --> 25:16.680
You can't even make your act convincing,

25:17.270 --> 25:19.510
and actually dare to shout at my Jiuyuan?

25:21.720 --> 25:22.720
You're actually...

25:23.440 --> 25:24.700
You're actually pregnant?

25:25.640 --> 25:26.480
How could this be?

25:28.760 --> 25:29.430
Was it that day,

25:29.720 --> 25:30.230
when we...

25:30.550 --> 25:31.510
Catch that demon.

25:39.350 --> 25:40.510
How are you feeling now?

25:40.920 --> 25:42.000
You were deceived by this demon

25:42.550 --> 25:44.070
and couldn't tell the difference between us for a moment.

25:44.640 --> 25:45.900
It's just that you were already injured to begin with.

25:46.440 --> 25:46.890
Now,

25:46.920 --> 25:47.920
staying by this demon's side,

25:48.110 --> 25:48.930
you must be even more cautious.

25:59.270 --> 25:59.870
Remember,

26:00.300 --> 26:01.580
never touch their blue blood.

26:02.030 --> 26:03.150
Don't let them replace you.

26:07.440 --> 26:07.830
Move!

26:11.150 --> 26:11.720
Behave!

26:13.160 --> 26:14.270
You demon,

26:14.640 --> 26:15.590
your skills are just mediocre,

26:16.160 --> 26:17.880
yet you dare to impersonate me.

26:19.750 --> 26:20.880
I'll kill you right now

26:21.160 --> 26:21.960
and show everyone

26:22.310 --> 26:24.030
the consequences of impersonating me.

26:25.160 --> 26:26.450
You must remember what I said

26:27.200 --> 26:28.400
and be very careful of this demon.

26:28.980 --> 26:30.460
You're about to die, yet you dare to speak nonsense!

26:33.480 --> 26:34.590
A quick death

26:34.720 --> 26:36.000
would be too easy for you.

26:37.070 --> 26:37.480
You...

26:38.480 --> 26:39.200
My Lord,

26:39.720 --> 26:41.240
this disgusting demon

26:41.270 --> 26:42.420
deserves to die.

26:42.880 --> 26:44.380
Let's throw it down the mountain to feed the vultures!

26:56.040 --> 26:56.560
Jiuyuan,

26:57.350 --> 26:58.640
don't get so angry.

27:02.110 --> 27:03.640
Be careful not to hurt our child.

27:07.230 --> 27:10.120
[Eternal Sect]

27:25.480 --> 27:27.440
I've devoted my life to cultivation.

27:28.140 --> 27:29.680
To die in the Eternal Sect

27:36.240 --> 27:37.350
is a good end.

27:39.000 --> 27:39.640
Master!

27:41.010 --> 27:41.560
Master!

27:41.590 --> 27:42.270
Master!

27:42.510 --> 27:43.270
Don't come over!

27:44.140 --> 27:44.790
What happened?

27:44.920 --> 27:46.400
This demon is a Two-headed Deceptive Python!

27:46.550 --> 27:47.750
Once its blood touches you,

27:47.750 --> 27:49.350
it will create a shadow person of you!

27:50.640 --> 27:51.110
Master!

27:51.270 --> 27:52.110
Senior, run!

27:52.350 --> 27:53.200
After I die,

27:54.400 --> 27:55.550
take over the position as the sovereign

27:56.550 --> 27:57.960
and find a way to eliminate this demon!

27:58.890 --> 27:59.320
Master!

27:59.350 --> 28:00.040
-Senior.
-Senior.

28:00.070 --> 28:00.590
Master!

28:00.590 --> 28:01.200
Run!

28:16.590 --> 28:17.790
Master!

28:35.790 --> 28:36.200
Mas...

28:37.510 --> 28:38.830
Master!

28:44.270 --> 28:46.110
Now, the Eternal Sect has already fallen.

28:46.920 --> 28:47.960
Other sects

28:48.310 --> 28:49.240
will soon follow.

28:51.330 --> 28:53.030
That Deceptive Python is truly an ultimate evil being.

28:53.920 --> 28:54.550
You were actually willing

28:54.550 --> 28:55.550
to release such a demon.

28:56.340 --> 28:57.540
It seems

28:58.070 --> 28:59.340
you're ready to end this game.

29:00.400 --> 29:02.160
If it weren't for someone tempting you back then,

29:02.430 --> 29:04.800
I would've already solved this game.

29:05.510 --> 29:06.270
I'm talking about...

29:07.400 --> 29:08.160
Mu Qingge.

29:10.110 --> 29:11.240
You're still testing me?

29:12.030 --> 29:12.660
Don't worry.

29:13.350 --> 29:14.830
I've already firmly taken control of this body.

29:15.590 --> 29:16.860
I'm not interested

29:17.400 --> 29:18.730
in his past foolishness.

29:21.110 --> 29:22.960
No wonder you're the Mortal-Demon Lord.

29:23.270 --> 29:24.310
I'm quite relieved.

29:24.880 --> 29:25.440
Look,

29:26.240 --> 29:27.750
the regal bearing on you

29:28.200 --> 29:29.510
has finally returned.

29:32.110 --> 29:32.750
Once we take control

29:32.750 --> 29:33.880
of all the spiritual channels,

29:34.110 --> 29:35.200
the 3000 worlds

29:35.270 --> 29:35.960
will be ours

29:36.550 --> 29:37.590
to roam freely.

29:41.350 --> 29:42.310
Is it only the spiritual channels?

29:45.440 --> 29:46.200
What are you trying to say?

29:47.000 --> 29:48.640
The spiritual channels are just the energy to activate the tower.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.240
If the tower's core is unstable

29:50.510 --> 29:51.590
and unable to bear this energy,

29:51.830 --> 29:53.070
all our efforts will eventually be in vain.

29:54.310 --> 29:55.030
Therefore,

29:55.350 --> 29:56.240
we must find

29:56.270 --> 29:57.720
the most suitable place in this world

29:58.070 --> 29:59.030
to serve as the tower's core.

30:04.640 --> 30:05.590
Where is this place?

30:07.920 --> 30:09.550
The Mortal-Demon Lord is truly is wise.

30:10.160 --> 30:10.720
Don't worry.

30:11.370 --> 30:12.170
I've already found

30:12.200 --> 30:13.240
the perfect location.

30:27.250 --> 30:27.880
Master!

30:28.880 --> 30:29.640
Master!

30:31.480 --> 30:32.000
Master!

30:32.200 --> 30:32.840
Master!

30:35.720 --> 30:37.240
Now, the sect has been occupied.

30:38.240 --> 30:39.000
Remember,

30:39.830 --> 30:41.680
they only have memories from the past few months.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.830
You can ask them about past details

30:44.200 --> 30:44.960
to determine

30:44.960 --> 30:46.310
the authenticity of those you know.

30:47.760 --> 30:48.360
Master!

30:48.510 --> 30:49.030
Master!

30:51.400 --> 30:52.880
Right now, I'm severely injured.

30:53.600 --> 30:54.600
I have to entrust

30:55.010 --> 30:56.490
the Hollow Sect to you for now.

30:57.790 --> 30:58.680
Master, be careful.

30:59.000 --> 30:59.720
Please sit down first.

31:01.060 --> 31:01.470
Hongshan!

31:02.020 --> 31:02.570
Sovereign Wen...

31:04.110 --> 31:04.680
Hongshan,

31:06.800 --> 31:07.650
I know that in the current situation,

31:07.680 --> 31:08.750
you can't trust anyone easily.

31:10.400 --> 31:11.590
This is a letter from Miss Ranran.

31:12.200 --> 31:13.640
She says she has found a way to counter the enemy

31:14.350 --> 31:15.160
and invites all the Heavenly Ones

31:16.110 --> 31:16.880
to go to the Wester Sect.

31:29.000 --> 31:30.400
It is indeed in Ranran's handwriting.

31:34.350 --> 31:35.320
How can you prove

31:35.480 --> 31:36.370
that you are the real you?

31:36.590 --> 31:37.960
You like the aloofness of plum blossoms the most

31:38.590 --> 31:39.680
and hate the flamboyance of peonies.

31:40.510 --> 31:41.350
Among all the landscapes in the mortal world,

31:41.980 --> 31:42.850
your favorite is Yueyang Tower.

31:42.880 --> 31:43.920
You've been there seven times.

31:44.550 --> 31:45.200
I secretly memorized

31:45.200 --> 31:46.110
all these things.

31:47.790 --> 31:48.530
If that's not enough,

31:49.200 --> 31:50.000
I can say more.

31:50.110 --> 31:50.550
Enough.

31:54.060 --> 31:54.650
Let's...

31:55.480 --> 31:56.570
Let's first settle my master,

31:57.400 --> 31:58.640
then we will go to the Wester Sect together.

32:17.510 --> 32:18.550
Tu Jiuyuan.

32:40.160 --> 32:40.680
Ranran.

32:41.590 --> 32:42.200
Elder Wen,

32:42.480 --> 32:43.070
Elder Yan.

32:45.750 --> 32:46.650
You demons!

32:46.790 --> 32:47.590
How dare you come here?

32:48.000 --> 32:49.270
Elder Wen, why did you say that?

32:50.310 --> 32:52.000
After we eliminated the demons in Mount Cold Autumn,

32:52.350 --> 32:53.640
we received a letter from the Wester Sect and came here.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.070
Why wouldn't we dare come?

32:55.830 --> 32:56.750
We saw Elder Wen's body

32:56.750 --> 32:57.880
at Mount Cold Autumn.

32:58.550 --> 32:59.030
I think

32:59.310 --> 33:00.070
you are the fake one.

33:01.000 --> 33:02.350
All the sects of the Heavenly Sects are here.

33:02.440 --> 33:03.350
You think you can take us on?

33:05.960 --> 33:06.910
You're also a demon!

33:08.160 --> 33:08.640
Be careful!

33:22.070 --> 33:23.270
What exactly is going on here?

33:23.920 --> 33:25.200
The records in the Xuantian Teachings mention

33:25.750 --> 33:27.350
that these shadow people are almost indistinguishable

33:27.590 --> 33:28.570
from their original bodies,

33:28.750 --> 33:29.590
with no flaws,

33:30.350 --> 33:31.400
and can gradually

33:31.550 --> 33:32.270
replace them.

33:32.750 --> 33:33.640
The only flaw is that,

33:34.000 --> 33:35.440
under the midday sunlight,

33:36.070 --> 33:37.920
the shadow people don't cast any shadows.

33:39.070 --> 33:39.640
That day,

33:39.790 --> 33:40.680
when I went to Mount Cold Autumn to eliminate the demons...

33:40.680 --> 33:41.270
There's a snake!

33:41.480 --> 33:42.200
There's a snake ahead!

33:42.750 --> 33:43.200
Miss,

33:43.640 --> 33:44.480
don't go any further.

33:44.790 --> 33:45.880
There's a python demon in the mountain.

33:46.000 --> 33:46.880
Hurry up and run.

33:47.160 --> 33:47.640
Uncle,

33:47.960 --> 33:49.070
I received your letter.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.400
I'm here to eliminate demons and uphold the Way.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.240
That's great!

33:55.640 --> 33:56.640
Where is that demon?

33:57.520 --> 33:58.210
It's right over there,

33:58.400 --> 33:59.440
deep in the dense forest.

34:00.640 --> 34:01.070
I realized

34:01.070 --> 34:02.200
none of them had shadows,

34:02.640 --> 34:04.240
which reminded me of the records in the Xuantian Teachings.

34:12.800 --> 34:13.480
Thanks to you,

34:14.550 --> 34:15.440
the Heavenly Sects have hope now.

34:15.920 --> 34:17.630
But these demons are too troublesome.

34:17.920 --> 34:18.800
We can't kill them all,

34:18.880 --> 34:19.800
and the more we kill, the more they multiply.

34:20.360 --> 34:20.920
I don't know

34:21.440 --> 34:22.510
what we should do in the future.

34:23.150 --> 34:23.670
Yes.

34:24.630 --> 34:26.030
Killing them only makes us hesitant to act.

34:26.400 --> 34:26.840
But if we don't kill them,

34:27.360 --> 34:28.630
they'll blend into our ranks.

34:29.190 --> 34:29.880
In this way,

34:30.440 --> 34:31.500
the fall of all major Heavenly Sects

34:32.000 --> 34:32.960
will only be a matter of time.

34:33.699 --> 34:34.830
We must quickly find a way

34:35.280 --> 34:36.400
a way to eradicate them.

34:37.400 --> 34:38.190
Before that,

34:38.590 --> 34:40.150
you should settle in the Wester Sect and have a rest,

34:40.400 --> 34:41.280
building up your strength

34:42.210 --> 34:43.290
and waiting for the chance to reclaim the mountain.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.510
Thank you, Ranran.

34:45.070 --> 34:46.670
Last time, they failed to attack the Heavenly Sects,

34:47.320 --> 34:48.409
and this time, they used shadow people

34:48.440 --> 34:49.550
to infiltrate and try to seize the spiritual channels.

34:50.190 --> 34:51.800
This must be for the Three Thousand Realms Tower again.

34:52.760 --> 34:53.550
The enemy is hidden while we are exposed.

34:53.760 --> 34:54.710
We can't just sit and wait for our doom.

34:55.110 --> 34:56.320
We must quickly uncover

34:56.630 --> 34:58.110
the origins of the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

34:58.770 --> 34:59.640
But the Heavenly Sects

34:59.670 --> 35:00.510
have been investigating for a long time

35:00.920 --> 35:01.670
and found no records.

35:02.150 --> 35:03.070
The Heavenly Sects may not know,

35:03.800 --> 35:04.550
but there is one person

35:05.030 --> 35:06.070
who might know about it.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.400
Let's do it this way.

35:20.110 --> 35:21.270
The annual ancestral worship ceremony

35:21.600 --> 35:22.890
is crucial for the nation's peace and stability.

35:23.290 --> 35:24.500
There must be no mistakes.

35:25.820 --> 35:27.010
Go ahead and prepare at the Ancestral Temple.

35:28.630 --> 35:29.070
Yes.

35:29.480 --> 35:31.320
I'll take my leave now.

35:39.550 --> 35:40.480
You may all leave now.

35:42.190 --> 35:42.880
Yes.

36:11.320 --> 36:12.840
You want to govern diligently and love your people,

36:13.510 --> 36:14.670
so you want to pray to the heavens.

36:15.280 --> 36:16.030
But the heavens

36:16.360 --> 36:17.710
did not grant you much time.

36:19.480 --> 36:21.510
You're already this sick before ascending the throne.

36:22.110 --> 36:23.440
How pathetic.

36:24.590 --> 36:25.710
Who let you in?

36:26.320 --> 36:26.960
Get out.

36:27.760 --> 36:30.070
Dun Tian told me to monitor you day and night.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.230
Seeing you cough like this,

36:32.720 --> 36:33.330
I had to come in

36:33.360 --> 36:34.550
and check on you.

36:35.320 --> 36:37.650
If anything happens to you,

36:38.280 --> 36:39.360
I wouldn't be able to explain it.

36:42.670 --> 36:44.320
You used to rely on your sister,

36:45.230 --> 36:46.630
and now you rely on Dun Tian.

36:47.960 --> 36:50.150
You've exhausted all your efforts in scheming across two lifetimes,

36:50.750 --> 36:52.520
yet you've never truly controlled

36:52.550 --> 36:53.510
your own fate.

36:54.620 --> 36:56.510
Don't you find yourself more pathetic?

36:56.670 --> 36:57.030
You...

37:00.480 --> 37:02.030
You're no better.

37:02.920 --> 37:04.110
You've been blindly

37:04.400 --> 37:06.070
loving Mu Qingge for two lifetimes,

37:06.630 --> 37:08.030
but in Mu Qingge's heart,

37:08.510 --> 37:10.280
there has always been only Su Yishui.

37:10.880 --> 37:12.920
There's not even the slightest room for you.

37:13.110 --> 37:13.880
Get out!

37:19.800 --> 37:20.870
Tell Dun Tian,

37:22.190 --> 37:23.440
he has trapped me in this palace

37:23.440 --> 37:24.110
for so long.

37:25.230 --> 37:27.110
I must attend the ancestral worship ceremony tomorrow.

37:28.280 --> 37:29.630
If he wants you to follow me,

37:30.710 --> 37:32.070
you must wait outside the temple

37:33.480 --> 37:34.800
and not come in to disturb me.

37:51.310 --> 37:56.370
[Imperial Ancestral Temple]

38:05.320 --> 38:06.070
You may all leave.

38:07.400 --> 38:08.030
Yes.

38:38.550 --> 38:39.110
Yu,

38:39.920 --> 38:40.480
it's me.

38:45.550 --> 38:46.230
Qingge.

38:48.760 --> 38:49.670
You're back.

38:51.320 --> 38:52.150
I've remembered

38:52.710 --> 38:53.800
everything from the past.

38:55.540 --> 38:56.540
I've been waiting for you.

38:58.110 --> 38:59.190
I knew that one day,

38:59.190 --> 39:00.020
you would come back.

39:07.000 --> 39:08.360
Yu, your body...

39:09.670 --> 39:11.150
has declined to this extent?

39:13.700 --> 39:14.510
Imperial physicians said

39:17.710 --> 39:18.390
I only have half a year left.

39:20.480 --> 39:21.150
Don't worry.

39:21.910 --> 39:22.680
I will make

39:22.710 --> 39:23.840
the best elixirs to save you.

39:25.870 --> 39:26.540
Qingge.

39:31.980 --> 39:32.960
You know this is not

39:32.960 --> 39:33.630
what I want to hear.

39:35.280 --> 39:36.480
In the past, you protected me

39:36.480 --> 39:37.150
for so many years.

39:38.710 --> 39:39.230
Have you...

39:44.000 --> 39:45.000
ever loved me?

39:47.160 --> 39:48.080
Whether as Mu Qingge

39:48.110 --> 39:49.000
or as Xue Ranran,

39:49.590 --> 39:51.030
I've always seen you as a friend,

39:51.400 --> 39:52.190
a confidant.

40:03.000 --> 40:03.670
I don't believe it.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.070
I don't believe it.

40:11.840 --> 40:13.000
If I hadn't asked you

40:13.000 --> 40:14.400
to save my ungrateful brother,

40:15.480 --> 40:16.920
you wouldn't have met Su Yishui,

40:17.760 --> 40:19.000
and you wouldn't have fallen in love with him later!

40:21.760 --> 40:23.110
If it weren't for that,

40:25.550 --> 40:26.880
you might have loved me,

40:28.510 --> 40:29.030
right?

40:34.960 --> 40:35.510
Right?

40:35.510 --> 40:36.280
Yu!

40:38.600 --> 40:39.410
I don't casually say things

40:39.440 --> 40:40.550
that never happened.

40:41.320 --> 40:42.400
The more we look back on the past,

40:43.110 --> 40:44.110
the deeper we get trapped in it.

40:44.880 --> 40:45.920
Don't fall too deep.

40:46.800 --> 40:47.230
No!

40:48.290 --> 40:49.520
Since Dun Tian gave me this chance,

40:49.550 --> 40:50.630
I must go back and take a look!

40:52.230 --> 40:53.710
Even if you and I still miss each other,

40:55.060 --> 40:55.640
I can always

40:55.670 --> 40:56.710
go to a new world,

40:57.760 --> 40:59.360
a world where only you and I exist,

41:00.110 --> 41:01.740
a world without Su Yishui.

41:02.960 --> 41:04.190
Among the 3000 worlds that will descend,

41:05.720 --> 41:06.960
there must be one

41:08.800 --> 41:09.960
where you love me.

41:11.590 --> 41:12.440
There must be one

41:14.050 --> 41:14.850
where everything

41:14.880 --> 41:15.840
is perfect for me.

41:17.550 --> 41:19.320
There's no perfection in this world.

41:20.400 --> 41:21.190
Even if it exists,

41:22.000 --> 41:23.840
if it comes at the cost of erasing others,

41:24.590 --> 41:25.880
can it really be called perfect?

41:27.040 --> 41:27.770
Yu,

41:28.760 --> 41:30.400
the reason people are different

41:30.960 --> 41:32.550
is simply due to their different experiences.

41:34.200 --> 41:35.330
Even if you replace

41:35.360 --> 41:36.360
a perfect Su Yu,

41:36.880 --> 41:37.520
with the people around you

41:37.550 --> 41:39.030
not sharing the same memories as you,

41:39.850 --> 41:40.520
that body

41:40.550 --> 41:41.920
will be nothing but an empty shell.

41:43.400 --> 41:44.360
In such a world,

41:45.000 --> 41:46.150
you'll only feel even more lonely.

41:50.550 --> 41:51.360
Besides, Yu,

41:52.760 --> 41:55.000
do you know that once the Three Thousand Realms Tower is activated,

41:55.760 --> 41:56.930
the world before you

41:56.960 --> 41:57.590
will be destroyed?

41:58.440 --> 42:00.250
The people you claim to love,

42:00.360 --> 42:01.400
the lands you've vowed to protect,

42:01.650 --> 42:02.770
will all vanish in an instant

42:02.800 --> 42:03.840
because of your whim.

42:10.110 --> 42:10.710
Yu,

42:14.760 --> 42:15.840
in this world,

42:17.200 --> 42:18.600
even though you have many regrets,

42:19.630 --> 42:21.070
at least you still have me as a friend

42:22.100 --> 42:23.390
and Feihua's companionship.

42:25.760 --> 42:27.150
If all of this were to disappear,

42:28.510 --> 42:29.630
wouldn't you feel regretful?

42:42.920 --> 42:43.670
Yu,

42:44.850 --> 42:45.520
come with me.

42:46.110 --> 42:47.280
I will do my best to save you.

42:53.150 --> 42:54.150
As long as I'm here,

42:55.060 --> 42:56.620
you'll never take Su Yu away.

43:02.760 --> 43:03.320
Wu,

43:04.070 --> 43:05.630
On the day you returned my spiritual power,

43:06.000 --> 43:06.880
I already decided

43:06.880 --> 43:07.840
that our debts were settled

43:08.290 --> 43:09.570
and I wouldn't hold anything against you.

43:10.280 --> 43:11.880
In the previous life, you already made a mistake.

43:12.760 --> 43:14.110
In this life, you're still obsessed,

43:14.590 --> 43:15.550
making one mistake after another.

43:15.960 --> 43:16.960
When will you turn back?

43:17.830 --> 43:19.100
My mistake

43:19.630 --> 43:21.360
is not making you perish into ashes

43:21.800 --> 43:23.480
when we were in the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation.
